<title>CANADA: Canadian Gas Assoc storage survey - June 6.</title>
<headline>Canadian Gas Assoc storage survey - June 6.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canadian Gas Association (CGA) weekly survey of Canadian natural gas in storage in billion cubic feet (bcf) for the week ended June 6:</p>
<p>							 Pct Full  Pct Full</p>
<p>		 06/06/97  05/30/97  Pct Full  Week Ago  Year Ago</p>
<p>East	     41.77     34.84     18.0	15.0	15.6</p>
<p>West	     94.36     86.07     36.4	33.2	41.2</p>
<p>Total Canada  136.14    120.91     27.7	24.6	29.6</p>
<p>East-West division is the Manitoba/Saskatchewan and North Dakota/Minnesota borders.</p>
<p>East capacity 06/06/97: 232.55 bcf, 05/30/97: 232.55 bcf.</p>
</text>
